As you may recall my main char is tromping around the dungon with a
tame Olaghai.  He killed the Dark One with just two hits of Magicbane.
Now he's in what looks like some catacombs (right below Medusa who was
also a wimp).

Anyway, I felt my luck chaning, so I saved and started a throwaway.
Well I guess my luck hadn't changed yet, since everything seemed to go
right.  By level 4, this wizard had Magicbane.  While making water, he
unleased a water demon.  Instead of that being the end of him, the
water demon gave him a wish.  +2 Silver Dragonscale mail! (In
retrospect, I should probably have wished for a wand of wishing since I
started out with a scroll of charging too).  Sokoban was clearly easily
with a stincking cloud clearing out the zoo for me.  He ended up with
the amulet instead of the bag wich was rather useless with the silver
dragonscale mail..  The mines provided two bags tho and a coaligned
temple.  They also provided a polymorph trap wich polymorphed one his
dogs into a red dragon.

Clear out some more levels, then a throne room.  Then trouble strikes.
Being extremely low on HP against several oppoenents (and the dragon no
where in sight), he ended up using both teleport scrolls, then finally
still in trouble he had no choice but to use a wand of digging to
escape. Oh that was worse, b/c he ended up in the big room.  But near
the down stairs.  A quick #prayer and he was able to flee down (yeah I
know not the best idea, but going up wasnt' an option in either case).
He comes to a room with a chest, three locked doors, and a T that just
wouldn't die.  Finally he kills and eats the T.

I decide to clear out this level before going back up.  I picked up two
pets and found the portal to Ft. Luidos.  Back up with my new pets.
Clear out the big room (only had to flee down a few more times).  Up to
get my pets (especially my dragon) and head for the Ft.  On the way to
the Ft. an energy vortex appears.  What did I do with that ring of
shock resistance?!?  Oh that's right I sold it b/c I thought  just grid
bugs shocked you.  Well the dragon will take care of it.  Oh my the
dragon is dead and I'm engulfed now.  Luckily Magicbane scared it and I
got out safely.  I ate the dragon corpse too.

The Ft I didn't get past the moat.  The zoo and the soliders were
rather easy.  Since I didn't want to risk walking in the water, I
decided to head down again and go for the quest.  The next level I
found the ic portal and started on the quest.

Now I was better equipped this time than the first time I met the Dark
One. But things didn't exactly go well.  I lost both pets on the way
down.  I get to the jail.  Clear out everything easily.  Then to the
Dark One.  Wack on him with magic missles then Magicbane.  He doesn't
die.  Instead he summons a Jabberwalk and dissappears.  I finally kill
the J and #offer him on the alter, converting it.  I see the DO fled to
the upstairs.  He then proceeds to reappear, hit me, and disappear ever
turn or two.  Sometimes he summons stuff.  I make it to the upstairs
and and he flees up.  So up I go.  Same thing happens only this time a
green slime, and two black dragons appear.  I've never seen a green
slime, and I so should have read the spolier sooner.  Lucikly a #prayer
saves me from that horror.

Up another level chasing the DO.  I just can't seem to make any
progress.  Every time Magicbane probes him he's still got something
like 75hp.  I end up having to flee down back to the jail.  He followed
me this time and summoned more scary stuff.  It soon ended and he won.

What did I do wrong this time?  Was I just really lucky the first time
I found the DO?

